WEBVTT

00:10:28.276 --> 00:10:34.036
"Girgorou" means "beautiful" in Jirrbal,
my grandmother's language.

00:10:34.756 --> 00:10:38.596
I now know that my girgorou is mighty,

00:10:38.636 --> 00:10:40.316
like Barangaroo.

00:10:40.316 --> 00:10:42.396
And my girgorou, like Walu,

00:10:42.436 --> 00:10:44.796
it’s everlasting,

00:10:44.796 --> 00:10:48.356
from when that sun rises
to when that sun sets.

00:10:49.276 --> 00:10:52.956
Are you ready to embrace your girgorou?

00:10:53.596 --> 00:10:54.796
Thank you.

00:10:54.796 --> 00:10:56.796
(Applause)